{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1011_p", "source_sha256": "01ff5e34bf587196becb075adadeccb4ee99d588a9eb662427ad818c936ed3cb", "ja": "どうしたんだ？　何か気になることがあるなら、\n遠慮しないで言っていいんだぞ。", "zh": "怎么了？要是有什么在意的事，就别顾虑，尽管说出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "c9955d83d722d5c5d7ed30c3565f7daa16ddda2ca14454c37269ed9833c37e0b", "ja": "ん……。あのね……。", "zh": "嗯……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "8135f5c0779b6e49c03e23e36cc120c2a34ed05cc6bfa27c24c84b92ab6057a6", "ja": "{$P$}さん……いつも、杏奈と\nゲームして……お話、聞いてくれる……けど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……总是陪杏奈玩游戏……还会听杏奈说话……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "e0e8c2f170dd60b92b9b81319bdf86e20438c66a436bf94e7bf6b87d33ef3599", "ja": "お仕事、あるから…………\n迷惑……かけてる、かなって……。", "zh": "因为你还有工作…………\n我在想……是不是给你添麻烦了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d9cd1a75a66269f93ec8e96bc7a0d1517ee68b94750098a06f9e2ff3767ad7bd", "ja": "迷惑じゃないよ、俺も気分転換になるからな。\n杏奈とゲームすると、そのあと仕事が頑張れるんだ。", "zh": "这不算添麻烦，我也正好能转换一下心情嘛。\n和杏奈一起玩游戏之后，工作也更有干劲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "3868b8e5cb0fd1e321366230efdd26e68d557fbc25ebcd3bf8de8e440876acdc", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。じゃあ……\n杏奈と、ゲーム……してくれますか……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……那么……可以和杏奈一起……玩游戏吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0a1aa4df6d29c25343951ca5a344caca2c8b53b6ebfcac12b666fe2be0f0d339", "ja": "もちろん！　それに、杏奈はゲームが上手だからな。\nプレイを見ているだけでも、楽しいんだよ。", "zh": "当然！而且，杏奈很擅长玩游戏。光是看她玩，我也觉得很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b70ce8a4e02d9811cf719930c94fdcef8ac0896559482505e8275a9e7a429b7e", "ja": "杏奈は本当に、ゲームが好きなんだな！", "zh": "杏奈真的很喜欢游戏啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "f9ad15729a72c14466d44f7b13d37857dcec5868d64571c882af466e1ca5386d", "ja": "うん……。ゲームは、杏奈じゃない……\n違う杏奈に、なれて……楽しい、です……。", "zh": "嗯……。游戏能让我，变成……\n不是杏奈的……另一个杏奈……很开心……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1020_p", "source_sha256": "059e6d05bcd22ec0a2b3d1acdd7b94c110262232e0f357b4cabf294d287e6af1", "ja": "そうか。\n……杏奈は、違う自分になりたいのか？", "zh": "这样啊。\n……杏奈是想成为不一样的自己吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "f6d317c5c099801f771b49b2f95973088612764b86383c8008a56d158962436c", "ja": "えっと……杏奈の、なりたい人は……\nみんな、テレビの中に……います……。", "zh": "那个……杏奈想成为的人……\n全都在电视里……】【。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "0140a2c77ee01827070311e2693a7d2c0fa04b73758bc2d13aff06be8a386bc1", "ja": "ゲームをすれば、杏奈も……勇者になれたの……\n冒険、したり……モンスターと、戦ったり……。", "zh": "玩游戏的话，杏奈也能……成为勇者……\n去冒险……或者和怪物战斗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "140ab17ea8759130b08bb1b09130e116cdca09ebcef343c821f7d64b1c45cc28", "ja": "でも……ゲームをしても、アイドルには、\nなれなくて……だから……。", "zh": "可是……就算玩游戏，也没能成为偶像……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fe7ea7af4ea69d921e15a8f45c3fc1873705bf33de4e6ee594a0bedc9717cf13", "ja": "そうか。\n……だから初めて会った時、歌ってたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊。\n……所以第一次见面的时候，你才在唱歌啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1025_024ann", "source_sha256": "ca2430072856a683e9bee533cc7c42bf6cf9ac30e098eb9317da243389947837", "ja": "うん……。\nマネだけなら、杏奈にも……できるから……。", "zh": "嗯……。\n只是模仿的话，杏奈也……做得到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "dd3419072288ccb7d2d850c4a839a2d6f08ed90111c94928e8755c6694150fb7", "ja": "アイドル……かわいくて、キラキラしてて……\n杏奈……見てると、ふふってなる……♪", "zh": "偶像……可爱又闪闪发光……\n看着偶像，杏奈就会忍不住笑出来……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
