{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "3c433dbf6b54bff665f2abebe1b170d962ea9c924b6dc1d7ba38ba1816ce5256", "ja": "杏奈も、ちゃんとキラキラしてるよ。\nもっとキラキラできると思う。", "zh": "杏奈也一直在闪闪发光哦。\n我觉得你还能变得更加闪耀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
