{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "d706bb82126135b764a2566fd9be8a3c3cf16eaef21e773f98e0913d1887e88e", "ja": "うん……{$P$}さん……杏奈の話、\nいつも聞いてくれて……ありがとう……。", "zh": "嗯……{$P$}先生……谢谢你……\n总是听杏奈说话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "6e01b197fd9cec316ed5be6db960eed2e90e097647931944768888ca8206bed6", "ja": "杏奈……{$P$}さんの、\nアイドルになれて……すごく、うれしい……です……♪", "zh": "杏奈……能成为{$P$}先生的偶像……真的非常开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_024ann_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_024ann_004_1034_p", "source_sha256": "94db4ebde2da2082bc2a2c586a584786698640b1d62e5f6e829060e0152cd824", "ja": "お礼を言うのは、こっちかな。\n来てくれてありがとう、杏奈。", "zh": "该说谢谢的，应该是我才对。谢谢你愿意来，杏奈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
